      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable and supportive store staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently praise the helpful team members for guiding them on reptile habitats, nutrition, and aquarium care. Several reviewers highlight personal assistance with special dietary needs and minor pet treatments. However, isolated complaints mention rude or dismissive interactions near closing time."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Care for diverse animal species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers appreciate the healthy condition of tropical fish, reptiles, and live insects available across the shop. Visitors mention bringing their dogs in to be spoiled by staff. A few negative reviews raise concerns regarding enclosure conditions for small rodents and the health of newly purchased pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Extensive product range and stock"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers describe the store as surprisingly spacious with a vast selection of feeds, tanks, and specialised accessories. Many long-standing customers value having a comprehensive local shop in Lewisham. A couple of visitors note that certain areas feel dark or could benefit from layout improvements."
      }
    }
  ],
